							"top": 112,
							"width": 449,
							"height": 219,
							"text": "//Pile(Zone des References) //Declarer un objet\nclient: Client\n\nclient1,client2: Client\nclient3: Client\n   \n//TAS(Zone des Valeurs) //Instanciation\nclient<--new Client()\nclient1<--new Client()\n\nclient2<--client\necrire(client.nom)\n\nclient2.nom<--Diallo\n\nEcrire(client.nom)//Diallo\nclient3 <--{...client1}\n\n\n"
